const PEOPI_STORE_EXPORT_GUIDE_MD = `# PEOPI APP ICON & STORE ASSETS EXPORT SPECIFICATIONS
Status: Draft store concepts (v1.0)
Verification Date: October 2026
Verified Sources:
- Apple App Store Connect Screenshot Specs:
  https://developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/reference/app-information/screenshot-specifications/
- Apple App Icon Guidelines:
  https://developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/manage-app-information/add-an-app-icon/
- Google Play Store Preview Assets:
  https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/9866151
- Android Adaptive Icon Specs:
  https://developer.android.com/distribute/google-play/resources/icon-design-specifications

---

## 1. APP ICON SPECIFICATIONS
- Source Artwork: 1024 × 1024 px square, NO rounded corners in master source.
- Position & Proportions: Approved small 'p.' glyph centered optically with standard clear space.
- Color: #FF3300 (Peopi Primary Orange), #FFFFFF (White glyph).
- iOS Delivery (Assets.xcassets): 1024 × 1024 px PNG (sRGB, 24-bit, no transparency/alpha).
- Google Play Store Icon: 512 × 512 px PNG (32-bit with alpha, up to 1024 KB).
- Android Launcher (Adaptive Icon): 108 × 108 dp foreground with transparent background.

---

## 2. STORE SCREENSHOT SPECIFICATIONS
### Apple App Store
- Primary Slot (6.7" Super Retina): 1290 × 2796 px (Portrait)
- Alternate Slot (6.5" Display): 1242 × 2688 px (Portrait)
- iPad Pro (12.9" Display): 2048 × 2732 px (Portrait)
- Capture Status: Prototype captures (to be replaced with release-build captures on physical devices).

### Google Play Console
- Phone Screenshots: Minimum 1080 × 1920 px (16:9) or 1080 × 2400 px (20:9).
- Capture Status: Draft concept — Android capture pending.

---

## 3. FEATURE GRAPHIC (Google Play)
- Dimensions: 1024 × 500 px (True aspect ratio 1024 / 500).
- File Format: JPEG or 24-bit PNG (no transparency).
- Safe Zone: Key typography and logos placed inside center safe margin.
`;

