const PEOPI_PRESS_DESCRIPTIONS = {
  sentence: "Peopi is an intent-based proximity networking app that helps professionals discover and connect with nearby peers in real time.",
  short: "Peopi helps professionals connect with intent. Using real-time proximity discovery, members see who is nearby, what they are open to, and connect through mutual requests. Built for conferences, coworking spaces and business districts, Peopi turns nearby presence into relevant professional conversations.",
  full: "Networking often happens by chance or not at all. Peopi bridges the gap between digital professional profiles and physical presence. The app enables professionals to discover peers within their immediate area, understand their professional intent through contextual badges, and initiate contact through a respectful request-and-accept model. With built-in privacy controls including hide presence and configurable discoverability, Peopi creates safe, intentional professional serendipity at events, coworking hubs and business districts worldwide."
};

const PEOPI_PRESS_README_MD = `# Peopi Press & Media Kit (Draft Materials)
**Version:** 1.0 (Prototype Specification)
**Brand Color:** #FF3300 (Peopi Orange)
**Typographic Hierarchy:** Manrope 800 (Headings & Display), Manrope 500-700 (Body & Interface)

## 01. Product Boilerplate
### One-sentence description (18 words)
Peopi is an intent-based proximity networking app that helps professionals discover and connect with nearby peers in real time.

### Short description (48 words)
Peopi helps professionals connect with intent. Using real-time proximity discovery, members see who is nearby, what they are open to, and connect through mutual requests. Built for conferences, coworking spaces and business districts, Peopi turns nearby presence into relevant professional conversations.

### Full description (92 words)
Networking often happens by chance or not at all. Peopi bridges the gap between digital professional profiles and physical presence. The app enables professionals to discover peers within their immediate area, understand their professional intent through contextual badges, and initiate contact through a respectful request-and-accept model. With built-in privacy controls including hide presence and configurable discoverability, Peopi creates safe, intentional professional serendipity at events, coworking hubs and business districts worldwide.

## 02. Brand Asset Guidelines
- The wordmark "peopi." must always preserve the orange terminal period (#FF3300).
- The official app symbol is a rounded squircle with the lower optical baseline for the "p." mark. Never enlarge or center the "p." arbitrarily.
- Always provide clear space around the logo equal to at least the height of the terminal dot.

## 03. Prototype Captures Notice
All screenshots included in this kit represent working mobile prototype builds. Please replace prototype captures with release-build captures prior to publication.

## 04. Media Contact
*Contact pending. Add a verified contact before sharing this kit publicly.*
`;

const PEOPI_PARTNER_README_MD = `# Peopi Partner & Ecosystem Pack (Draft Materials)
**Document:** Partnership & Introduction Overview
**Confidentiality:** For partner and evaluation use only

## Contents of this pack:
1. **peopi-presentation-deck-16x9.pptx** — Complete 6-slide narrative presentation covering the problem, solution, intent architecture, and platform roadmap.
2. **peopi-product-one-pager-A4.pdf** — Executive summary one-pager formatted for print and digital review.
3. **peopi-product-one-pager-editable.docx** — Fully editable Word template for custom partner proposals.
4. **logos/** — Vector SVG assets for approved co-branding (light and dark wordmarks, master app symbol).
5. **brand-usage-rules.txt** — Co-branding clear space, color values, and trademark guidelines.

## Key Differentiation:
- **Intent over Chance:** Members declare professional intent before discovering nearby peers.
- **Mutual Request-and-Accept:** No unsolicited broadcast messaging; both parties must mutually agree.
- **Privacy First:** Instant presence toggle ("Hide presence") and zero persistent background tracking.
`;

