 motion:dsPanel('Motion guidelines','<p>Welcome orbit breathing uses 7s and 9s cycles. Suggested controls: 150–250ms; panels: 250–400ms. Honor reduced-motion settings.</p>')+dsPanel('Accessibility','<p>Maintain readable contrast, clear focus, descriptive labels and practical touch targets. Audit 9–12px labels before production.</p>'),
 components:dsPanel('Buttons','<div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap"><button class="ds-demo-btn">I’m Open ↗</button><button class="ds-demo-btn secondary">Secondary</button><button class="ds-demo-btn outline">Outline</button><button class="ds-demo-btn" disabled>Disabled</button></div>')+dsPanel('Inputs & patterns','<input aria-label="Sample message" placeholder="Write a message..." style="padding:15px;border:1px solid #dce1e9;border-radius:14px;font:14px Manrope"><p>Next: cards, navigation, bottom sheets, avatars, chat bubbles, tabs and their interaction states.</p>'),
 states:dsPanel('Truthful feedback','<p>Visibility, verification and connection requests must have explicit labels. Hide presence is different from blocking. No fabricated map activity.</p>')+dsPanel('Empty and error states','<p>Include zero results, permission denied, retry, message failure and session end states.</p>'),
