        <p>The token set defines <code>sm (8px)</code>, <code>md (12px)</code>, <code>lg (16px)</code>, <code>xl (24px)</code>, and <code>pill (999px)</code>. Production mobile screens currently use 21–24px on floating profile cards, 28px on bottom sheets, and 12px on discovery controls. Per system stability rules, existing screen implementations preserve their calibrated radius values without arbitrary redesign.</p>
